    ('0867af66-9b0a-421b-981d-d01ddfb5d4e6'::uuid, 'Espresso Midi Jean Elbisee', 'Espresso kahverengi, vücuda oturan midi elbise. Kumaş denim benzeri, hafif esnek; mat durur, parlamaz. Açık renk kot dikişi (topstitch) yakada, kol evinde ve etek ucunda görünür.

Sivri polo yaka, V yaka. Kolsuz; kol evi omuzu biraz örter, sütyen askısı kolay gizlenir. Önde üç gümüş düğme — süs, fermuar değil. Belde yatay büzgü; göbek şişirmez, beli toplar.

Fermuar yanda, kol evinin hemen altında, kumaş rengine yakın ve ince. Sırtta fermuar yok; orta dikiş. 
Etek ucunda yırtmaç var. Boyu diz altı midi, kalem etek silüeti.', null, 'available', 'fashion', 3, '["XS","S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL"]'::jsonb, '{"L":1,"M":1,"S":1,"XL":0,"XS":0,"2XL":0,"3XL":0}'::jsonb, '{"color":"Espresso","gender":"Kadın","length":"Midi","zipper":"Yan fermuar","sleeves":"Kolsuz","stretch":"Hafif esnek","neckline":"V yaka","aiModelId":"studio:selin","decollete":"Hafif","silhouette":"Vücuda oturan","colorGroupId":"ae723d38-5e4b-45c4-b83d-437ece980af1","manualListing":true,"colorSiblingIds":["fc78f5ef-53b9-4f85-8de6-80b3c63fd3e3","0867af66-9b0a-421b-981d-d01ddfb5d4e6"],"lifestyleModelIds":["studio:selin"]}'::jsonb, '["https://qjxclaggqzhfaqihwdle.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/tr-assets/6202207c-9b0f-4c0e-be3b-0ea8df24cf52/2b2b1a07-3a58-4422-bc67-e274b0fa6d1d/original/22421a35-6947-4251-9992-262ba143c843.webp","https://qjxclaggqzhfaqihwdle.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/tr-assets/6202207c-9b0f-4c0e-be3b-0ea8df24cf52/2b2b1a07-3a58-4422-bc67-e274b0fa6d1d/original/89bfcd1a-995a-454c-9820-358d5145f680.webp","https://qjxclaggqzhfaqihwdle.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/tr-assets/6202207c-9b0f-4c0e-be3b-0ea8df24cf52/2b2b1a07-3a58-4422-bc67-e274b0fa6d1d/original/76f17426-0c7d-4667-aa96-0f8ab4c0a2d9.webp","https://qjxclaggqzhfaqihwdle.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/tr-assets/6202207c-9b0f-4c0e-be3b-0ea8df24cf52/2b2b1a07-3a58-4422-bc67-e274b0fa6d1d/original/9e0247b9-5de4-40b5-ab9d-8268f044fc20.webp","https://qjxclaggqzhfaqihwdle.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/tr-assets/6202207c-9b0f-4c0e-be3b-0ea8df24cf52/2b2b1a07-3a58-4422-bc67-e274b0fa6d1d/original/e49393ed-792c-4e5e-a812-7203ff4b3491.webp","https://qjxclaggqzhfaqihwdle.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/tr-assets/6202207c-9b0f-4c0e-be3b-0ea8df24cf52/2b2b1a07-3a58-4422-bc67-e274b0fa6d1d/original/f65f5e77-4938-492b-8d65-3e73c15c95a4.webp","https://qjxclaggqzhfaqihwdle.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/tr-assets/6202207c-9b0f-4c0e-be3b-0ea8df24cf52/2b2b1a07-3a58-4422-bc67-